				{ type = "quest", id = 1197 },
			},
			text = [=[The water of the moonwell would douse the flame in {link:splithoof-crag}Splithoof Hold{/link} only for a short while. It was long enough. The Cloven Hoof was carried out of the {link:centaurs}centaur{/link} stronghold, and Rau felt a strange energy moving within it. He believes it will tell the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} surprising things about the centaur, and he has begun to decipher it.]=],
